PATH-MAPPING NOTE (no silent drift, covenant #9)
  The prompt's idealized output path is apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Analytics/YearReviewPage.swift, but the
  REAL Xcode project (apps/apple/project.yml) compiles app sources from apps/apple/Sources/** — the
  TeslaSync/Features/** subtree is NOT a build input (project.yml lists Sources, TeslaSync/feature-views,
  dashboard-widgets, misc-surfaces, shared-surfaces, widget-primitives — no TeslaSync/Features). The already-DONE
  sibling pages page:analytics/Statistics + page:analytics/FleetCompare both live under
  apps/apple/Sources/Features/Analytics/. Placing the page there is what actually compiles, registers, and is
  covered by the gate; the alternative would be a non-compiled, non-registered stub (covenant #4). Files therefore
  live under apps/apple/Sources/Features/Analytics/** + the matching Tests/Unit/Features/Analytics/ test dir.

NAME-COLLISION NOTE (no silent drift, covenant #9)
  The TeslaSync module already ships a separate YearReview parity track (the p4-apple feature-views slide
  components TeslaSync/feature-views/{SummarySlide,SavingsSlide,SlideRenderer,...} and the dashboard widget
  TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets/YearReviewWidget*). Those define three model types whose names I had independently
  chosen — YearReviewSummary, YearReviewVehicle, YearReviewFormat. To avoid a module-level redeclaration/ambiguity
  (the first build RED'd with 42 "'YearReviewSummary' is ambiguous" cascade errors), this page's equivalents were
  renamed to the collision-free YearReviewStorySummary / YearReviewStoryVehicle / YearReviewStoryFormat
  (verified unique: `grep YearReviewStory*` over TeslaSync/ = 0 pre-existing). The pre-existing YearReviewSummary
  is a small WIDGET projection (year/vehicle/totalDrives/totalDistanceKm/totalEnergyKwh/totalChargeSessions/
  co2OffsetKg/gasSavings only) and lacks this page's fields (drive highlights, monthly_stats, patterns, charging
  mix, comparisons), so reuse was not viable; the page keeps its own SI-canonical models (Statistics pattern).
  All other YearReview* names this page introduces (YearReviewPage, YearReviewPageModel, YearReviewSlide,
  YearReviewPhase, YearReview{Title,Distance,Drives,...}Slide, YearReviewDrivesChart, ...) are unique.

