case or alias. A new .yearReview case was added (pathSegment "year-review"); AppRouteParser.parse already strips
the trailing :year segment via firstSegment matching, so /year-review/2026 deep-links resolve with no parser
change. The case was added to ALL exhaustive AppRoute switches (systemImage, group) + pathSegment; no sibling
case was displaced. The new case surfaces in the Insights sidebar group + the command palette (paletteCommands
maps AppRoute.allCases) — i.e. reachable + deep-linkable. No other exhaustive AppRoute switch broke (full build
error count stayed 4, all in the pre-existing Input.Previews.swift; a non-exhaustive-switch regression would add
"switch must be exhaustive" diagnostics — none appeared). The model is built @MainActor in the registration enum
and captured, mirroring the sibling *RouteRegistration enums.

